'''Orbs of Lightning''' are objects that appear during the fight with [[Akkha]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]], where they appear if he unleashes his Trailing Orbs attack, and the player moves whilst in the south-east quadrant. It will damage and temporarily disable protection prayers if players walk into one.

